                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJE68F9QipQjQRMZMejOOrL9g/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214RVpVOHdPSFZ3YlVwWU9ERnhlVEJ2V2pWV05YYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "7 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Shang Lin Coffee is a old fashion cafe located in a quiet lane. Stepping into the cafe it\u0027s like a step back in time with its old furnishings. But make no mistake, the sole owner and batista takes pride in his work. The place is immaculately clean and he is nearly dressed.\nBut the best thing here is of course the coffee! Each cup is made with attention and care and you can taste it from the very first sip! The 60+ years old batista knows his craft well! I had coffee and lattes daily and it\u0027s not often a coffee give my taste buds a nice surprise. The place is quite in the morning and is said to get busy with the locals old folks in the afternoon.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
